  "goodToKnow": "Der Hubschrauber is a helicopter. Literally, it's a lift-screw: from der Hub (lift, from heben) and die Schraube (screw, propeller). Der Helikopter is a common synonym. Germany has a dense network of Rettungshubschrauber (air ambulances), such as the ADAC's yellow Christoph helicopters, which reach most places within 15 minutes. Helikoptereltern are over-protective parents."
